<p>NOTES: Net loss for quarter was due primarily to charges and write-offs totalling about $76 million, including $40 million in revenue adjustments and $9 million for bad debt, and $10 million in inventory adjustments, related mainly to obsolete items.</p>
<p>Also included in the charges was about $17 million for legal settlements and associated costs, settlement regarding the company's termination of its planned merger with Vitas Healthcare Corp and termination of a pension plan from Abbey Healthcare Group Inc.</p>
<p>Full company name is Apria Healthcare Group Inc</p>
